{title: Kya Baat Ay}
{artist: B Praak Harrdy Sandhu}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
Tera [F#m] mukhda chand da tukda,        Ni tere ainak, tere shoe
[D] Kya Baat ay,        [E] Kya Baat ay [F#m]
[F#m] Ni tera kajal,        [F#m] Karda aye pagal
[F#m] Hypnotize kare jatt nu,        [D] Kya baat hai!
[E] Kya baat hai! [F#m],        Tere [F#m] lak to lagda Karachi di
Fan marjaaniye [F#m] Buggati di,        [Bm] Dil kare tere naal bhaneya rava
Tere [F#m] jisam chh khushboo eilaichi di,        Teri [F#m] akhh, te tikha nak
[F#m] Te utto mashaallah munh,        [D] Kya baat ay!
[E] Kya baat aye! [F#m],        [F#m] Tera kangna kangna kangna;
[F#m] Kya baat,        Lak [F#m] nu paaiyan-paaiyan badi marjaniye
[D] Tenu takk ke mainu,        [E] Aande gandey thought marjaniye
[F#m] Gallan ne gulaabi vich toye nakhro,        [F#m] Kar de ne mundey hoye hoye nakhro
[Bm] Jehda tenu tak leve ik vaar ni,        [F#m] 3-4 mahiney ta naa soye nakhro
Teri [F#m] chaal tey gallan laal,        [F#m] Tey saari di saari hi tu
[D] Kya baat ay?        [E] Kya baat ay? [F#m]
[F#m] Janni jaani jaani jaani jaani,        [F#m] Jaani nu tu aagi ae pasand baliye
[F#m] Tapne nu phirre tere kandh baliye,        Menu [Bm] seene naal la le
Na keh no! no! no!        Tere [F#m] bina menu maar du ay thand baliye
Ni bull [F#m] gulaabi,        [F#m] Karrn sharabi
[F#m] Jutti kar di ae chu chu...
